    {
     "type": "text",
     "narration": "Even their writing reflects it. In hieroglyphs, the sign for traveling south shows a boat with its sail up. Traveling north, the sail is down.",
     "data": {
      "kicker": "Hieroglyphs",
      "text": "Sail up: going south. Sail down: going north.",
      "highlight": [
       "south",
       "north"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "narration": "And the flood may even help explain the pyramids. Many historians think that during the months when the fields were underwater, farmers were free to work on the pharaohs' building projects.",
     "data": {
      "text": "When the fields flooded, farmers could build",
      "highlight": [
